{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — the door of a member's page (The Circle, 29 September 2026).

  Rendered by ha-circle-prefs and ha-circle-share INSTEAD of their content
  when the visitor is not a member. Liquid runs on Shopify's server, so a
  non-member's page never contains the form: this is not a menu being hidden
  (Aloha's page 7: "Hiding a menu is insufficient"). A member is a customer
  whose Circle status (customer metafield hartwick.circle_status) is Approved
  — the same test as the header's Circle drawer. An account alone grants
  nothing.

  The words are hers, from the About The Circle page.

  Accepts:
  - crumb: the page's reference line
  - text: richtext shown to the visitor
  - back_url / back_text: the way back to About The Circle
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="ha-wrap ha-cgate">
  {%- if crumb != blank -%}<p class="ha-cgate__crumb ha-record">{{ crumb }}</p>{%- endif -%}
  <div class="ha-cgate__text ha-narrate">{{ text | default: '<p>The Circle is by invitation. Already invited? Sign in with the email address linked to your invitation.</p>' }}</div>
  <div class="ha-cgate__actions">
    {%- unless customer -%}
      {%- if shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
        <a class="ha-cmembers__button ha-record" href="{{ routes.account_login_url }}">{{ signin_text | default: 'Member sign in' }}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
    {%- if back_url != blank -%}
      <a class="ha-cgate__back ha-record" href="{{ back_url }}">{{ back_text | default: 'Back to the Circle' }}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>
